I created my Digital Literacy infographic using Prezi, a dynamic presentation tool that transforms static slides into zoomable,
interconnected canvases—perfect for visually mapping complex concepts like digital safety and global trends. 

DESIGN OVERVIEW: My infographic covers three core pillars— Finding/Evaluating Information , Creating/Communicating Content , and Safety/Ethics
 A striking India vs Global Digital Proficiency chart (2012-2025) showing our nation's rapid growth. 
The "INSURE YOUR SAFETY" section lists 5 critical Don'ts (no personal info sharing, avoid phishing links, etc.), 
while "Pro Tips" highlights student essentials like Source Verification and Portfolio Building.
It ends with an inspiring quote about digital citizenship.

 Path animation timing was tricky—getting smooth zooms between the proficiency chart, safety rules, and tips required precise second-by-second adjustments. 
